# Deny-by-default: this working directory contains a lot of large vendored
# source trees, build output, and raw data pulled off the physical device
# (firmware blobs, eMMC/RAM dumps, decompiled vendor kernel source) that
# must never be committed here -- see README.md "What's NOT in this repo
# and why" for the reasoning. Rather than trying to enumerate every such
# path (new ones get created constantly during active investigation),
# everything is ignored by default and only the specific, reviewed files
# below are allowed back in.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!COMMUNITY_HELP_REQUEST.md
!BUTTON_PROBING_PLAN.md

!patches/
!patches/**
!board-port/
!board-port/assemble_image.sh
!board-port/extlinux.conf
!board-port/future_features_notes.md
!board-port/sun50i-a133-trimui-smartpro.dts
!board-port/trimui-smartpro_defconfig
!board-port/trimui_smartpro_br_defconfig
!board-port/trimui-smartpro_kernel_defconfig
!board-port/update_sd_kernel.sh
!tools/
!tools/devmem.c
!tools/drmtest.c
!tools/backup_restore/
!tools/backup_restore/**
!vendor-notes/
!vendor-notes/**
